    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446230/extras/a5f257b64d7223471f653f215e8ee719.avif?t=1755280394\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battery Farm is a thought provoking, narrative-based, horror game created by a solo developer for Symbolic Crow Creations, LLC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446230/extras/d2231fc1b8663e7c2e1bdf6c0ed13d9a.poster.avif?t=1755280394\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446230/extras/d2231fc1b8663e7c2e1bdf6c0ed13d9a.webm?t=1755280394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446230/extras/d2231fc1b8663e7c2e1bdf6c0ed13d9a.mp4?t=1755280394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446230/extras/bff493ffd8ff5213417fe76c59127f0b.avif?t=1755280394\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You meet up with 3 friends for a late night grave robbery that goes horribly wrong and sends you deep into an abstract and surreal journey.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446230/extras/a3fda57054d37637406849b263467178.poster.avif?t=1755280394\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446230/extras/a3fda57054d37637406849b263467178.webm?t=1755280394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446230/extras/a3fda57054d37637406849b263467178.mp4?t=1755280394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446230/extras/ff28537d7e5eadf2939f9514a5203759.avif?t=1755280394\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battery Farm is a narrative based first person horror game / walking simulator.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446230/extras/9d472fec45363c54ee9d1d88106784ee.poster.avif?t=1755280394\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446230/extras/9d472fec45363c54ee9d1d88106784ee.webm?t=1755280394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446230/extras/9d472fec45363c54ee9d1d88106784ee.mp4?t=1755280394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446230/extras/3643b7879fad7505602bdcaa763f24a8.avif?t=1755280394\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 2-3 hours of gameplay\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear story\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to play, simple controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walking Simulator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mixture of Terrifying, Absurd and Thought Provoking moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several endings based on player decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446230/extras/0ac69f6bc832279d00ac99ef14451937.poster.avif?t=1755280394\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446230/extras/0ac69f6bc832279d00ac99ef14451937.webm?t=1755280394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446230/extras/0ac69f6bc832279d00ac99ef14451937.mp4?t=1755280394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
